  "description": "The Olympic Village is full of athletes chasing glory, but Korean volleyball star Han Taeoh finds himself chasing something else entirely. After a charged encounter with Liam, a charismatic rugby player from the British national team, Taeoh cannot hide his attraction. His bold flirting quickly pulls them together, and the tension between them leads to a night neither of them expected. Taeoh believes it will remain a secret Olympic fling. Unfortunately, their story does not end there.\nSource: TappyToon",
